  "instance_name": "racial_hierarchy_stereotype",
  "label": "Racial Hierarchy Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme reinforces a harmful narrative of racial hierarchy and economic victimhood by portraying Black South Africans as passive recipients of exploitation. This stereotype is based on the implicit knowledge that racial hierarchies exist and that Black people are often portrayed as inferior or less capable in economic contexts. The meme uses this knowledge to justify the accusation and to frame the speaker's attitude as one of contempt and superiority.",
